      "skos:definition": [
        {
          "@value": "Together, open Standards, open Technologies, open Architectures and open Content represent a next-generation ‘full-STAC’ remedy for digital health transformation."
        }
      ],
      "skos:scopeNote": "Quoted from the abstract. The paper calls it both an approach and a remedy, and names the four as 'four factors'. The DPI-H RA draft (sec-022, footnote 14) cites this paper and presents the four as 'the enabling conditions for REDDHI'.",
